{
  "slug": "wizard",
  "name": "Wizard",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Wizard turns any recurring task you do with AI into a reusable workflow (\"a spell\") that runs in one command. At its core it's a meta-builder: it interviews you about a task you already do, drafts a tested SKILL.md, and saves it to your personal library. Or point it at a chat session that worked and it'll infer the spell directly. Ships with 25 hand-crafted spells covering research, writing, decisions, planning, status updates, code review, debugging, and more — plus the meta-builder that lets you grow your own. Every generated spell is end-to-end-tested before being saved (Iron Law). MIT, no telemetry.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**, **1 agent**, **6 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `building-a-discipline-spell` (Use when the meta-builder routes to kind=discipline), `building-a-spell` (Use when the user wants to capture a repeatable task as a reusable spell, or asks \"how do…), `building-a-subagent-spell` (Use when the meta-builder routes to kind=subagent), `building-a-workflow-spell` (Use when the meta-builder routes to kind=workflow), `chaining-spells` (Use when composing multiple spells into a chain that runs end-to-end (e.g), `discovering-spells` (Use when browsing what spells are available - bundled seeds, your personal library, or both), `inferring-a-spell-from-examples` (Use when the user invokes /capture-this-chat or /build-spell --from-transcript), `intuitive-interviewing` (Use when conducting any interview-style flow with a user (building a spell, refining one, gathering requirements)), and 4 more\n- **Agents** (1): `spell-tester` (Subagent dispatched during the try-it phase of building-a-spell)\n- **Commands** (6): `build-spell` (Start building a new spell from a task you do repeatedly), `capture-this-chat` (Turn the current chat session into a reusable spell), `cast-spell` (Run a spell from your library), `list-spells` (Browse all available spells (yours plus bundled)), `refine-spell` (Improve an existing spell based on real usage), `share-spell` (Export a spell for sharing with others)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wizard@claude-community` from `redhuntlabs/wizard`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 12,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 6
  },
